{"id":"NCT07890376","title":"A Study to Investigate the Effect of LY4086940 Versus Placebo in Participants With Obesity or Overweight and Without Type 2 Diabetes","official":"A Phase 2, Parallel-Group, Double-Blind Study to Investigate Weight Management With LY4086940 Compared With Placebo in Adult Participants With Obesity or Overweight and Without Type 2 Diabetes","summary":"The purpose of this study, performed under the master protocol W8M-MC- CWMM (NCT06143956), is to evaluate the efficacy and safety of LY4086940 compared with placebo in participants without type 2 diabetes who have obesity or who have overweight with a weight-related health condition.\n\nParticipation in the study will last about 58 weeks.","conditions":["Obesity","Overweight"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"LY4086940"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Meet inclusion criteria under Master Protocol CWMM (NCT06143956)\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\nIn addition to exclusion criteria under Master Protocol CWMM (NCT06143956)\n\n* Have any prior diagnosis of type 2 diabetes, type 1 diabetes, or rare forms of diabetes mellitus, except gestational diabetes\n* Have a laboratory value suggestive of diabetes\n* Have any of the following cardiovascular conditions within 6 months prior to screening:\n\n  * acute myocardial infarction\n  * cerebrovascular accident (stroke)\n  * unstable angina, or\n  * hospitalization due to congestive heart failure\n* Have a known personal or family history (first-degree relative) of multiple endocrine neoplasia type 2A or 2B, thyroid C-cell hyperplasia, or medullary thyroid carcinoma.\n* Within 6 months prior to screening, have taken medications (prescribed or over the counter) or alternative remedies (including herbal or nutritional supplements) that promote weight loss","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"75 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":460,"start":"2026-11","pcd":"2028-01","upd":"2026-11-03","sponsor":"Eli Lilly and Company","areas":["other"],"central":["Trial questions or participation questions: 1-877-CTLILLY (1-877-285-4559) or · 317-615-4559 · LillyTrials@Lilly.com","Physicians interested in becoming principal investigators please contact · clinical_inquiry_hub@lilly.com"],"sites":[{"f":"The Institute for Liver Health II dba Arizona Clinical Trials - Mesa","city":"Chandler","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85225","s":"NYR","lat":33.3062,"lon":-111.8413,"c":""},{"f":"Headlands Research - Scottsdale","city":"Scottsdale","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85260","s":"NYR","lat":33.5092,"lon":-111.899,"c":""},{"f":"The Institute for Liver Health II dba Arizona Liver Health-Tucson","city":"Tucson","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85712","s":"NYR","lat":32.2217,"lon":-110.9265,"c":""},{"f":"NorCal Medical Research, Inc","city":"Greenbrae","pr":"California","zip":"94904","s":"NYR","lat":37.9485,"lon":-122.5247,"c":""},{"f":"Velocity Clinical Research, Huntington Park","city":"Huntington Park","pr":"California","zip":"90255","s":"NYR","lat":33.9817,"lon":-118.2251,"c":""},{"f":"Peninsula Research Associates","city":"Rolling Hills Estates","pr":"California","zip":"90274","s":"NYR","lat":33.7878,"lon":-118.3581,"c":""},{"f":"Diablo Clinical Research, Inc.","city":"Walnut Creek","pr":"California","zip":"94598","s":"NYR","lat":37.9063,"lon":-122.065,"c":""},{"f":"Stamford Therapeutics Consortium","city":"Stamford","pr":"Connecticut","zip":"06905","s":"NYR","lat":41.0534,"lon":-73.5387,"c":""},{"f":"New Horizon Research Center","city":"Miami","pr":"Florida","zip":"33165","s":"NYR","lat":25.7743,"lon":-80.1937,"c":""},{"f":"Indago Research & Health Center, Inc","city":"Miami Lakes","pr":"Florida","zip":"33016","s":"NYR","lat":25.9087,"lon":-80.3087,"c":""},{"f":"Suncoast Clinical Research, Inc.","city":"New Port Richey","pr":"Florida","zip":"34652","s":"NYR","lat":28.2442,"lon":-82.7193,"c":""},{"f":"Charter Research - Winter Park","city":"Orlando","pr":"Florida","zip":"